Subject: [PATCH] fix(kanban): retire stored model restrictions in owner
 dispatch [daveey]

Dispatcher-owned bounded rotation clears legacy stored selectors and mandatory flags via exact-value CAS, with audit and standard sync field clocks. Refused body lines become reversible historical JSON evidence through supported body editing. Live run, claim and session custody remain untouched.

Proof: new retirement regressions RED before implementation; 24 focused tests GREEN including real dispatch_once and field-HLC/SQLite replica readback with in-memory Board transport. scripts/check --base origin/main passed. Full Kanban consumer suite running; canonical publication, independent exact-head review and required CI still pending.
